<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>로그인 · 조선소 생산 KPI 대시보드</title>
  <style>
    :root { --bg: #f8fafc; --fg: #0f172a; --card: #ffffff; --line: #e2e8f0; --crit-bg: #fee2e2; --crit-fg: #991b1b; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root:not([data-theme="light"]) { --bg: #0f172a; --fg: #e2e8f0; --card: #1e293b; --line: #334155; --crit-bg: #450a0a; --crit-fg: #fecaca; }
    }
    body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); font-family: "Malgun Gothic", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", sans-serif; }
    main { max-width: 360px; margin: 64px auto; padding: 16px; }
    form { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    label { display: grid; gap: 4px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    input { padding: 8px; font-size: 1rem; }
    button { padding: 8px; font-size: 1rem; }
    .alert { background: var(--crit-bg); color: var(--crit-fg); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>🔐 로그인</h1>
  <% if (error) { %><div class="alert" role="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %>
  <form method="post" action="/login" autocomplete="off">
    <label>사번 <input name="employee_no" required inputmode="numeric"></label>
    <label>이름 <input name="name" required></label>
    <button type="submit">로그인</button>
  </form>
  <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#64748b">사번과 이름은 등록된 명단과 대조합니다.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
